  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fcgwZZjIG8c\"><strong>在 YouTube 上觀看</strong></a> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>替代雨聲</strong> 資源包將預設的雨天和雷聲替換為更真實且富有氛圍的音效。現在雨聲聽起來比預設的 Minecraft 音效豐富許多。雷聲也經過更新，聽起來更具戲劇性與力量感。有了這個資源包，你將能更沉浸於遊戲之中。希望你能喜歡 :)</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>常見問題：</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">任何人都可以在他們的模組包中使用這個資源包。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">授權與原始音效：</span></li>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<a href=\"remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fnatural-thunder-113219%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/rain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803/</a></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<a href=\"remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fnatural-thunder-113219%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/soft-rain-ambient-111154/</a></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<a href=\"remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fnatural-thunder-113219%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/natural-thunder-113219/</a></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<a href=\"remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fbone666138%252fsounds%252f198857%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/bone666138/sounds/198857/</a></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<a href=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fthunder-24571%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/thunder-24571/</a></span></p>",
